{"id": "unknown-2026-09-09-018", "date": "2026-09-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["carbon_emissions"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Fortera and MLC sign agreement for commercial production facility", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/fortera-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>US:</strong> Fortera and Mississippi Lime Company (MLC) have signed an agreement to develop a commercial facility that will produce more than 300,000t/yr of the company’s low-carbon ReAct cement product. Fortera's ReCarb technology will capture CO₂ emissions from MLC's production of high-calcium lime, converting the CO₂ directly into cement.</p>\n<p>\"This partnership gives us the opportunity to scale our prod", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21218-fortera-and-mlc-sign-agreement-for-commercial-production-facility", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-09-019", "date": "2026-09-09", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["capacity"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["涉及產能"]}, "title": "Uzbekistan cement production reaches 12.1Mt", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.globalcement.com/images/news/uzbekistan-flag-1500.jpg\" /></p><p><strong>Uzbekistan: </strong>Cement plants in Uzbekistan produced 12.1Mt of cement in the first seven months of the year, according to the National Statistics Committee. This represents an increase of 0.1Mt or 0.8% year-on-year from the same period of 2025, when cement production totalled 12Mt. From January to July 2024, cement production reached 9.1Mt.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "global_cement", "url": "https://www.globalcement.com/news/21215-uzbekistan-cement-production-reaches-12-1mt", "type": "rss"}]}
